OL,3,GNEWSATwo men admit murdering man
OL,4,Astabbed in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have admitted the murder of a
OL,7,Fman found stabbed in a street in
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,10,FChristopher Bradbury, 44, died on
OL,11,FRidgway Road, near Hanley Park, in the
OL,12,FShelton area on 23 July.
OL,14,FSubhan Nadeem, 20, and Dhannish
OL,15,FMahmood, 19, both from Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,16,Fappeared at the city's crown court on
OL,17,FMonday where they entered guilty pleas.
OL,18,FThey will be sentenced at a later date.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
